From: handylinux <8155246+handylinux@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 05:07:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] patch 144: ammo weights for encumbrance tracking

Set weight on all 42 ammo entries (only ammo_fusion_core had one).
Values approximate real-world masses in pounds so calibres differ
sensibly: a cannonball is not a 10mm round.

- gunpowder rounds 0.02-0.26 (full cartridge mass)
- thrown/projectiles 0.02-12
- energy 0.03-0.25
- ammo_anything = 0 (marker for Junk Jet, not an item)
- book values kept as-is: missile 7, mini-nuke 12, fusion core 4/20 charges

Inventory already multiplies weight by quantity, so encumbrance
from ammo starts working with no code change.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
